ac sweeps
control
  analysis a1 ac from=1k to=2k step=100
  analysis a2 ac from=1k to=2k mode="lin" points=10
  analysis a3 ac from=1 to=1G mode="dec" points=10
  analysis a4 ac from=1 to=1k mode="oct" points=3
  analysis a5 ac values=[1k, 2k, 5k]
  analysis a6 ac from=1 to=1k mode="dec" points=n
  analysis a7 ac from=1 to=1k mode="lin" points=n-1
  analysis a8 ac from=1 to=1k mode="lin" points=n
endc
